# Event$ Moved | ValidCard$ Creature.!token+!wasCast | ReplaceWith$ Exile:
# "If a nontoken creature would enter and it wasn't cast, exile it instead."
# Zombify returns Grizzly Bears from the graveyard; the entry is replaced
# before the card moves, so the Bears go to exile and never enter.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
tapformana human 6 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets 7
castspell human 1
resolvestack
